for slice(r7) -> L1 else L10 stages [L1, L5, L6, L7, L8, L9]
// L1: free {take, const, <}
// L5: cycle Control in_order {branch}
// L6: free {take, assign, ref, call to_string, assign, ref, as_slice}
// L7: cycle Order(r10) in_order {spawn print, eval}
// L8: free {const}
// L9: cycle Carried(r11) any_order law(Op(Add) exact commutative) {+}
// control chained through L5
// cost W=23 O=18305 split when n > 25468, n ≤ len(r7)
